"text":"On 8/14/26 02:23, Nathan Chancellor wrote:"},{"depth":1,"text":">   In file included from drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/dpu1/dpu_hw_sspp_v13.c:7:"},{"depth":1,"text":">   include/linux/soc/qcom/ubwc.h: In function 'qcom_ubwc_config_get_data':"},{"depth":1,"text":">   include/linux/soc/qcom/ubwc.h:45:16: error: implicit declaration of function 'ERR_PTR' [-Wimplicit-function-declaration]"},{"depth":1,"text":">      45 |         return ERR_PTR(-EOPNOTSUPP);"},{"depth":1,"text":">         |                ^~~~~~~"},{"depth":1,"text":">   include/linux/soc/qcom/ubwc.h:45:25: error: 'EOPNOTSUPP' undeclared (first use in this function)"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"Hi Nathan,"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"This issue is pre-existing and I've sent a separate fix for it:"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"https://lore.kernel.org/all/5fy7l6o5nfzclsmhsqys562xwoilbo4xv3af65kcqugtitgltd@3fw2w443pw2g/#r"}],"lineCount":13,"maximumDepth":1},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Sure, it is a pre-existing issue but it is only exposed by making\nCONFIG_QCOM_UBWC_CONFIG an optional selection for these drivers, so I\nthink that patch should be a part of this series. Otherwise, I don't see\nhow you could actually trigger such an error."},{"kind":"signature","text":"Cheers,\nNathan","lineCount":2}],"patchIds":[],"attachmentMetadata":[],"sourceOrdinal":0,"diagnostics":[],"declaredParentMessageId":"0b9128de-e2d9-4271-97b8-9fa0c7f6fa3c@oss.nxp.com"}},"rootIds":["20260814170621.GA532729@ax162"],"childrenByParent":{},"chronologicalIds":["20260814170621.GA532729@ax162"],"patchSeries":[],"diagnostics":[],"patches":{}}}